### Зарегистрироваться
POST http://localhost:8080/car/signUp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "firstName": "Ivan",
  "lastName": "Ivanov",
  "password": "Qwerty"
}

### Зарегистрироваться
POST http://localhost:8080/car/signUp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin1",
  "firstName": "Ivan",
  "lastName": "Ivanov",
  "password": "Qwerty"
}

### Авторизоваться
POST http://localhost:8080/car/auth
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin&password=Qwerty

### Выйти из системы
DELETE http://localhost:8080/car/auth

### Получить пользователя по id
GET http://localhost:8080/car/user?id=1

### Обновить информацию о себе
PUT http://localhost:8080/car/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Petr",
  "lastName": "Ivanov",
  "carIds": [6, 8]
}
